    {
      "source": "No collisions will occur with the keys generated by this class.\nThe returned <a href=\"SimpleKey.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.cache.interceptor\"><code>SimpleKey</code></a> object can be safely used with a\n<a href=\"../concurrent/ConcurrentMapCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.cache.concurrent\"><code>ConcurrentMapCache</code></a>, however,\nmight not be suitable for all <a href=\"../Cache.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a>\nimplementations.",
      "translation": "使用此类生成的键不会发生冲突。返回的<a href=\"SimpleKey.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.cache.interceptor\"><code>SimpleKey</code></a>对象可以安全地与<a href=\"../concurrent/ConcurrentMapCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.cache.concurrent\"><code>ConcurrentMapCache</code></a>一起使用，但可能不适用于所有<a href=\"../Cache.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a>实现。",
      "count": 2
    },
